[00:07.45]
[00:18.23]i’ve been easily out of control, that
[00:22.66]i’m funny, understanding, unique and sweet
[00:27.50]a just soul to squeeze, but I also have parts
[00:34.51]that made them hated me
[00:37.68]
[00:53.060]my boys and girls were too smart when they’re in love
[00:57.210]they see life as two dear different parts
[01:01.429]that to me could ever be a sad thing
[01:07.829]so smart I am and they are
[01:16.260]so we’re only apart
[01:24.930]even love is much
[01:28.53]
[01:52.11]now I’ve become the silly one
[01:55.410]i laugh at the wrong time and say the things that people will surely embarrassed while they heard them
